!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/link-feed.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/40/m/meta.tn"
@doc:"""
  A family selected by its pins, a record holding a member of it, and a record no host class binds, declared by a
  schema importing meta.tn alone. `feed` selects its members by the pin on `format` ([TSON-SCHEMA] §5.2) and declares
  one, `atom_feed`; an importing schema adds members of its own. `subscription` holds a feed, as an entry's value or an
  annotation's. A processor that binds binds `subscription` and each member of `feed` to a host class of its own: the
  records `subscription`, `atom_feed` and `rss_feed`; a value of `bookmark` is held as written.
  """
!schema {
  feed         => { format: text =?  url: text }
  atom_feed    => feed & { format?: = "atom" }
  subscription => { feed: feed }
  bookmark     => { url: text }
}
